=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
  play firewall/debian13 ---------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Play mode: hardn's own screens and prompts, on the real$
# plan/apply engine against a simulated host, hostfake's$
# recording host.System, whose commands a model of the host$
# answers. Nothing on this machine changes: every command and$
# file is the fake's, and its record is shown when play ends.$
$
# Info: firewall/debian13$
# web-01.example.net runs Debian 13. ufw is not installed$
# (check-firewall.md §3: Debian installs it only on request,$
# [unverified]).$
$
# UFW Firewall Configuration ###################################$
$
  [ ] Firewall             Not Configured ufw not installed$
$
  ufw ----------------------------------------------------------$
$
  [ ] Installed            No$
$
  SSH ----------------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  [::]:22              Not filtered$
   -  0.0.0.0:22           Not filtered$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Install UFW          Install the ufw package$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Enter selection [0-1 or q]: 1$
$
  Checking the host...$
$
# Install UFW ##################################################$
$
  ufw ----------------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  Package              ufw$
   -  Status               Inactive$
$
   -  Install ufw$
      ufw$
      -not installed$
      +installed, inactive$
      $ apt-get install -y ufw$
$
  Install ufw? [y/N, 0 or q]: y$
$
  [+] Install ufw          Done$
$
# Operation Successful$
$
# UFW Firewall Configuration ###################################$
$
  [ ] Firewall             Not Configured inactive$
$
  ufw ----------------------------------------------------------$
$
  [+] Installed            Yes$
  [ ] Status               Inactive$
   -  Incoming policy      Deny$
  [ ] At boot              No$
$
  SSH ----------------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  [::]:22              Not filtered$
   -  0.0.0.0:22           Not filtered$
$
  Rules --------------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  No firewall rules configured$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Enable firewall      Let SSH through, then start ufw$
                           [ ] Lockout risk$
   2) Application Profiles Add, remove, apply$
   3) Trusted Interfaces   Add, remove, apply$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Enter selection [0-3 or q]: 0$
$
  simulated system ---------------------------------------------$
$
# Info: firewall/debian13$
# Recorded by the fake, not done: what each step ran on$
# web-01.example.net, and the files it changed, in order;$
# hardn's own journal, run directory and backups left out.$
$
   -  Applied: Install ufw$
      $ apt-get install -y ufw$
$

